              <h3>Symptoms of the missing controller</h3>
              <p>
                Slotted content renders with browser default styles (Times New Roman, raw blue links,
                no spacing). Styles appear correctly in Storybook but break in Drupal or production.
                <code>::slotted()</code> rules only apply to direct children — nested elements are unstyled.
              </p>
